    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2016_0311","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Piotr Kowalczyk talks about the brushstroke that got away. The artist brought a canvas, unwrapped it, looked at it, and wrapped it again.</Description>
